@Control
.
=CONTROL
.
.IF chooses, and DO, FOR and REPEAT loop. EXIT leaves a loop, CONTINUE starts
.its next pass, and GOTO jumps to a label.
.
.A condition is true when it is not 0. A compare is compiled straight to a
.branch, with no 0 or 1 in between. AND and OR between compares stop as soon
.as the answer is known: in A AND B, B is not tested when A is false.
.
.AND and OR are bitwise, so IF A AND 4 tests bit 2. To test two values for
.not 0, write IF A <> 0 AND B <> 0.
.
.See IF, DO, FOR, REPEAT, EXIT and CONTINUE, GOTO.
.
=SEE ALSO
.
